All claims check out against the repository: `npm test` runs jest, `CheckoutForm.tsx` exists alongside `__tests__/CheckoutForm.spec.tsx`, and both husky hooks (branch-name regex in pre-commit, commitlint in commit-msg) match exactly. The two minted roles (checkout-form-engineer, checkout-form-detective) are asserted as ground truth per instructions, not checkable. No false claims found.

